// The application's icon, compiled into the executable by `build.rs`.
//
// The id has to be 1. That is the id Windows asks for when it wants "the" icon of a program — the
// one on the desktop, in the task bar, in Alt-Tab — and it is the id GPUI's Windows backend loads
// and gives to the window class it registers, so one resource answers all of them.
//
// The path is relative to this file: `embed-resource` runs the resource compiler in the directory
// the `.rc` lives in.
1 ICON "app.ico"
